From 940403d0fc6029f3f3081edfbe5412dd8d6c6e8f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Brendan Lynskey <brendanlynskey@googlemail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 01:17:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] hw/char: add the BRV32P UART

A model of the UART of the BRV32P SoC (8N1, 16-bit clock divider,
interrupt on receive-data-valid), register-exact to the RTL, including the
transmit and receive frame times and the single-word bus accesses of the
peripheral bridge.

Signed-off-by: Brendan Lynskey <brendanlynskey@googlemail.com>

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 hw/char/Kconfig               |   3 +
 hw/char/brv32p_uart.c         | 295 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 hw/char/meson.build           |   1 +
 include/hw/char/brv32p_uart.h |  61 +++++++
 4 files changed, 360 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 hw/char/brv32p_uart.c
 create mode 100644 include/hw/char/brv32p_uart.h

